<title>BRAZIL: Too soon to say if CVRD auction suspended.</title>
<headline>Too soon to say if CVRD auction suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokeswoman for Brazil's Planning Ministry said it was too soon to say whether or not a high court injunction against the government would mean a suspension of the April 29 privatization auction of mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said lawyers for Brazil's National Development Bank (BNDES), were studying the injunction issued earlier on Tuesday by Justice Marco Aurelio de Mello.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't know whether this will cause a postponement or not,&quot; the spokeswoman for Planning Minister Antonio Kandir told reporters.</p>
</text>
